cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Reactio Draw in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Reactio Draw"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source chemical structure and reaction editor for organic chemists: drawing with the
  mouse or the keyboard, a reagent table built from the scheme, analysis and HRMS, NMR prediction,
  CDXML and CDX files, and Word and PowerPoint objects. It runs in the browser or as an app for
  Windows, Mac and Linux, and can be embedded in other web pages.
authors:
  - family-names: "Sakharov"
    given-names: "Pavel"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7746-7387"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Paivel/reactio-draw"
url: "https://paivel.github.io/reactio-draw/web/"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - chemistry
  - chemical structure editor
  - reaction scheme
  - stoichiometry
  - cheminformatics
  - NMR prediction
  - CDXML
